      "markdown": "# Simple, Transparent Pricing\n\nChoose the plan that's right for your business.\n\n### Starter\n\nFor small business just getting started\n\n$29/month\n\n- 1,000 messages per month\n- Email support\n- Basic analytics\n- 1 team member\n- Website integration\n\n[Get Started](https://paystack.shop/pay/df-starter?email=undefined)\n\nMost Popular\n\n### Pro\n\nFor growing businesses scaling up\n\n$79/month\n\n- 5,000 messages per month\n- Priority email support\n- Advanced analytics\n- 4 team members (Comming soon)\n- Custom branding (Comming soon)\n- Connect with Whatsapp & Instagram (Comming soon)\n\n[Get Started](https://paystack.shop/pay/df-pro?email=undefined&name=undefined)\n\n### Enterprise\n\nFor large organizations with custom needs\n\nContact Us\n\n- 10,000+ messages per month\n- 24/7 priority support\n- Enterprise analytics (Comming soon)\n- Unlimited team members\n- Custom branding\n- Dedicated account manager\n- Custom integrations (Comming soon)\n\n[Contact Sales](https://www.deskforce.co.za/contact)\n\n### Need Something Custom?\n\nContact our sales team for a custom solution tailored to your specific requirements.\n\n[Get in Touch](https://www.deskforce.co.za/contact)",
