    "structured_content": "## Deskforce: AI-Powered Support Automation\n\nDeskforce offers an AI-powered chatbot solution to automate customer support, lead generation, and more.\n\n### Key Features\n\n*   **Intelligent Web Scraping:** Extracts content from your entire website, including subpages and hidden content to build a comprehensive knowledge base.\n*   **Knowledge Base Creation:** Automatically organizes and structures your website content.\n*   **AI-Powered Understanding:** Advanced algorithms understand the context and relationships between different content pieces.\n*   **Instant Support Bot:** Transforms your knowledge base into a chat support bot that answers customer questions.\n*   **Customization:** Personalize your support bot with your brand colors, logo, and messaging.\n*   **Data Security:** Your website content is processed securely and never shared.\n\n### How it Works\n\n1.  **Import Your Data:** Train your AI from various data sources, including websites and PDFs.\n2.  **Customize:** Setup your Agent persona and goals to fit your brand.\n3.  **Integrate:** Add your chatbot to your website or existing tools in a few clicks.\n4.  **Monitor and Manage:** Monitor conversations across all channels and utilize smart human takeover when needed.\n\n### Pricing\n\nChoose the plan that's right for your business.\n\n*   **For small business just getting started**\n    *   1,000 messages per month\n    *   Email support\n    *   Basic analytics\n    *   1 team member\n    *   Website integration\n*   **For growing businesses scaling up**\n    *   5,000 messages per month\n    *   Priority email support\n    *   Advanced analytics\n    *   4 team members (Coming soon)\n    *   Custom branding (Coming soon)\n    *   Connect with Whatsapp & Instagram (Coming soon)\n*   **For large organizations with custom needs**\n    *   10,000+ messages per month\n    *   24/7 priority support\n    *   Enterprise analytics (Coming soon)\n    *   Unlimited team members\n 